This plugin was created from the user-supplied ORVIBO Cloud Home Assistant
integration version 1.1.0, whose manifest credits @Kosztyk.

The REST signatures, encrypted framing, device profiles, TV codes and bundled
ORVIBO client certificate/key are ported from that supplied integration. The
certificate/key are application protocol assets, not an account token generated
for the user. Do not substitute personal certificates or account credentials in
these assets. No Home Assistant package or Python code is executed at runtime.

